{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112509","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112509/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112509/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112509/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112509","id":3600357119,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7WmRb_","number":112509,"title":"Renaming a scene externally does not update UID cache","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-11-07T13:29:42Z","updated_at":"2025-11-07T13:33:43Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.6 dev3\n4.5.1\n4.4.1\n\n### System information\n\nW10\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen you rename a scene externally, its UID will no longer be recognized. It disappears from FileSystem tooltip (though interestingly, Copy UID option is still there)\n\n<img width=\"176\" height=\"107\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dec0f570-88c1-4c29-ac34-d531a3b6a636\" />\n\nand trying to `load()` the UID returns null. What's worse, if you open the scene in the editor and save, it will have new UID assigned.\n\nIt seems to work correctly if the file is moved instead of renamed.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a scene (A)\n2. In another scene (B), add a script with `print(load(\"uid://uid of scene A\"))`\n3. Run scene B and verify that the scene is printed correctly\n4. Rename the scene A externally (i.e. outside Godot editor)\n5. Run scene B again, the code now prints null\n6. Open scene A in the editor and save it\n7. Notice that in the scene file, the UID has changed\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112509/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112509/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}